nd deadly past and sounds a warning to our possible future. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/573130/extras/38c0f7608ba228c1a96616ec817061a1.poster.avif?t=1760703641\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/573130/extras/38c0f7608ba228c1a96616ec817061a1.webm?t=1760703641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/573130/extras/38c0f7608ba228c1a96616ec817061a1.mp4?t=1760703641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong> - <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An immersive, detailed world created in CryEngine.<br></li><li>Explore a story about humanity, technology and civilization.<br></li><li>Avoid traps and solve brain twisting puzzles made to make you question what happened in The Valley.<br></li><li>Explore bizarre architecture and overgrown nature, choosing your own path in the game’s non-linear world.<br></li><li>Completely original musical score.</li></ul>",
